cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "corralctl: a local repository index for AI coding agents"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Rousseau
    given-names: Sebastien
    email: sebastian.rousseau@gmail.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/sebastienrousseau/corralctl"
url: "https://doc.corrallib.com"
abstract: >-
  corralctl clones and organises GitHub repositories into a structured local
  workspace, then exposes that workspace to AI coding agents over the Model
  Context Protocol. It answers questions about a developer's already-cloned
  repositories without a network round-trip.
keywords:
  - git
  - developer-tools
  - model-context-protocol
  - mcp
  - cli
  - golang
license: GPL-3.0-only
